    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41178" root="هزج" body-key="h">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُزَامِجٌ</span></b>  A voice, or the like, <i>of which the sounds
are closely consecutive.</i> The <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">م</span> is an augmentative
letter. (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَوْتٌ هُزَامِجٌ</span> <i>A confused voice</i>
or <i>sound.</i> The sound so called is less than what
is termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُغَآءٌ</span>. (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَزجٌ</span>.]

